225 1158 1701 (          A complete file specification containing all possible elements consists of a drive) 1701 SB
225 1217 1710 (       specification, a primary filename, a filetype, and a password, all separated by their) 1710 SB
225 1276 1107 (       appropriate delimiters, as in the following example:) 1107 SB
225 1395 723 (       A:DOCUMENT.LAW;SUSAN) 723 SB
