225 211 1743 (       tor-y, and therefore wildcards are valid only in filenames and filetypes.  You cannot) 1743 SB
225 270 1769 (       use a wildcard character in a drive specifier.  You also cannot use a wildcard charac-) 1769 SB
225 330 1235 (       ter as part of a filename or filetype when you create a file.) 1235 SB
