225 271 1670 (      Banked CP/M 3 allows you to edit your command line without deleting all char-) 1670 SB
225 331 1751 (    acters.  Using the line-editing control characters listed in Table 3-2, you can move the) 1751 SB
225 390 1711 (    cursor left and right to insert and delete characters in the middle of a command line.) 1711 SB
225 449 1641 (    You do not have to retype everything to the right of your correction.  In banked) 1641 SB
225 508 1726 (    CP/M 3, you can press RETURN when the cursor is in any position in the command) 1726 SB
225 567 1642 (    line; CP/M 3 reads the entire command line.  You can also recall a command for) 1642 SB
225 626 567 (    reediting and reexecution.) 567 SB
