225 1335 1679 (       You probably noticed that some control characters have the same meaning.  For) 1679 SB
225 1395 1723 (     example, the CTRL-J and CTRL-M keystrokes have the same effect as pressing the) 1723 SB
225 1454 1662 (     RETURN key; all three send the command line to CP/M 3 for processing.  Also,) 1662 SB
225 1513 1740 (     CTRL-H has the same effect as pressing the BACKSPACE key.  Notice that when a) 1740 SB
225 1572 1711 (     control character is displayed on your screen, it is preceded by an up-arrow, T. For) 1711 SB
225 1631 1289 (     example, a CTRL-C keystroke appears as TC on your screen.) 1289 SB
