225 152 1619 (      In response, the HELP utility displays a list of topics for which summaries are) 1619 SB
225 211 1552 (     available.  After HELP lists the topics available, it displays its own prompt:) 1552 SB
225 270 52 (    ) 52 SB
225 330 205 (    HELP>) 205 SB
225 448 1661 (    To this prompt, you can enter one of the topics presented in the list, for example,) 1661 SB
225 566 351 (    HELP>SHOW) 351 SB
225 685 1740 (    After displaying a summary of the SHOW command, HELP lists subtopics that detail) 1740 SB
225 744 1712 (    different aspects of the SHOW command.  To display the information on a subtopic) 1712 SB
225 803 1682 (    when you have just finished reading the main topic, enter the name of the subtopic) 1682 SB
225 862 480 (    preceded by a period,) 480 SB
225 980 456 (    HELP >. OPTIONS) 456 SB
