225 1158 1635 (    command.  As you become familiar with HELP, you might want to call a HELP) 1635 SB
225 1217 1096 (    subtopic directly from the system prompt as follows:) 1096 SB
225 1335 624 (    A>HELP SHOW OPTIONS) 624 SB
225 1454 1649 (      HELP lets you learn the basic CP/M 3 commands quickly.  You might find that) 1649 SB
225 1513 1672 (    you reference the command summary in Section 5 only when you need details not) 1672 SB
