225 744 1239 (                                     only some files of a particular filetype.) 1239 SB
225 862 1555 (                      Dn             Delete any characters past column n. This parameter) 1555 SB
225 921 1482 (                                     follows a source file that contains lines too long to) 1482 SB
225 980 1471 (                                     be handled by the destination device, for example,) 1471 SB
225 1040 1542 (                                     an 80-character printer or narrow console.  The num-) 1542 SB
225 1099 1477 (                                     ber n should be the maximum column width of the) 1477 SB
225 1158 850 (                                     destination device.) 850 SB
