225 1395 1499 (                                     the console as the copy is taking place.  The source) 1499 SB
225 1454 1041 (                                     must contain character data.) 1041 SB
225 1572 1459 (                         F           Filter form-feeds. When this parameter follows a) 1459 SB
225 1631 1511 (                                     source name, PIP removes all form-feeds embedded) 1511 SB
225 1690 1533 (                                     in the source data.  To change form-feeds set for one) 1533 SB
225 1750 1510 (                                     page length in the source file to another page length) 1510 SB
225 1809 1491 (                                     in the destination file, use the F command to delete) 1491 SB
225 1868 1484 (                                     the old form-feeds and a P command to simultane-) 1484 SB
