225 2105 1489 (                                     parameter follows a source name, PIP searches the) 1489 SB
225 2164 1527 (                                     directory of user number n for the source file.  When) 1527 SB
225 2223 1519 (                                     it follows the destination name, PIP places the desti-) 1519 SB
225 2282 1446 (                                     nation file in the user number specified by n. The) 1446 SB
225 2341 1212 (                                     number must be in the range 0 to 15.) 1212 SB
