225 152 1634 (                  the argument SAM is substituted for every $1 in the START.SUB file,) 1634 SB
225 211 1663 (                  and TEX for every occurrence of $2 in the START.SUB file.  SUBMIT) 1663 SB
225 270 1580 (                  then creates a file with the parameter substitutions and executes this) 1580 SB
225 330 1284 (                  file.  This file now contains the following commands:) 1284 SB
225 448 569 (                  ERA SAM.BAK) 569 SB
225 507 440 (                  DIR SAM) 440 SB
