225 152 1640 (     When entering a combination of numbers and letters, you might find it inconve-) 1640 SB
225 211 1695 (    nient to press a caps-lock key if your terminal translates the upper-case of numbers) 1695 SB
225 270 1667 (    to special characters.  ED provides two ways to translate your alphabetic input to) 1667 SB
225 330 1736 (    upper-case without affecting numbers.  The first is to enter the insert command letter) 1736 SB
225 389 1647 (    in uppercase: I. All alphabetics entered during the course of the capitalized com-) 1647 SB
