225 1631 1621 (    immediately to the ED prompt.  In the memory buffer, the CP appears after the) 1621 SB
225 1690 559 (    inserted string, as follows) 559 SB
225 1809 948 (        In 1870,^ Emily Dickinson said, <cr><If >) 948 SB
