225 1572 1666 (         ED supports a find command, F, that searches through the memory buffer and) 1666 SB
225 1631 1696 (       places the CP after the word or phrase you want.  The N command allows ED to) 1696 SB
225 1690 1652 (       search through the entire source file instead of just the buffer.  The J command) 1652 SB
225 1750 1086 (       searches for and then juxtaposes character strings.) 1086 SB
32 0 0 50 50 0 0 1 46 /MSTT31c370 font
