225 685 1733 (      It makes a difference whether you enter the F command in upper- or lower-case.  If) 1733 SB
225 744 1772 (     you enter F, ED internally translates the argument string to upper-case.  If you specify) 1772 SB
225 803 1647 (     fl ED looks for an exact match.  For example, Fcp/m 3 searches for CP/M 3 but) 1647 SB
225 862 1131 (     fcp/m 3 searches for cp/m 3, and cannot find CP/M 3.) 1131 SB
225 980 1585 (      If ED does not find a match for the string in the memory buffer, it issues the) 1585 SB
225 1040 244 (     message,) 244 SB
