225 270 1540 (      To move a group of lines from one area of your data to another, use an X) 1540 SB
225 330 1662 (    command to write the text block into a temporary LIB file, then a K command to) 1662 SB
225 389 1657 (    remove these lines from their original location, and finally an R command to read) 1657 SB
225 448 664 (    the block into its new location.) 664 SB
