225 625 1811 (             If no filename is specified, X$$$$$$$ is assumed.  If no filetype is specified, LIB is) 1811 SB
225 685 1821 (           assumed.  R inserts the library file in front of the CP; therefore, after the file is added) 1821 SB
225 744 1736 (           to the memory buffer, the CP points to the same character it did before the read,) 1736 SB
225 803 1817 (           although the character is on a new line number.  If you combine an R command with) 1817 SB
225 862 1793 (           other commands, you must separate the filename from subsequent command letters) 1793 SB
225 921 1791 (           with a CTRL-Z as in the following example where ED types the entire file to verify) 1791 SB
