225 2164 1734 (    an F command.  At this point, the character pointer is at the end of the buffer.  Move) 1734 SB
225 2223 1296 (    the CP with a B or n: line number command to resume editing.) 1296 SB
225 2341 418 (    BREAK "F" AT F) 418 SB
225 2400 304 (    DISK FULL) 304 SB
