225 775 1568 (          CTRL-C     Terminates the executing program and redisplays the system) 1568 SB
225 834 1631 (                            prompt, provided the cursor is at the beginning of the command) 1631 SB
225 894 1638 (                            line.  Also, if you halt scrolling with CTRL-S, you can terminate) 1638 SB
225 953 945 (                            the program with a CTRL-C.) 945 SB
